<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <EnablePackageValidation>true</EnablePackageValidation>
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>true</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
    <PackageId>PivotForge.Core</PackageId>
    <Version>0.6.0-preview.1</Version>
    <Authors>Alican</Authors>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) 2026 Alican</Copyright>
    <Title>PivotForge Core</Title>
    <Description>A fast, dependency-light pivot table engine for .NET. Build pivot results from objects, dictionaries, DataTables, JSON, and CSV with grouping, aggregation, filtering, sorting, show-as calculations, drill-down, pagination, cancellation, and Excel export.</Description>
    <PackageTags>pivot;pivot-table;pivot-grid;crosstab;aggregation;analytics;reporting;drill-down;excel;dotnet</PackageTags>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>false</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <PackageIcon>pivotforge-icon.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>Adds PivotGroupInterval: a date column collapses into year, quarter, month, day or weekday header groups, and the same column may occupy several levels at once, so a year over month hierarchy needs no second source column. Breaking: PivotRequest.Rows and Columns are now IReadOnlyList of PivotFieldRef rather than of string. A field name converts implicitly, so Rows = ["Region"] still compiles; code that reads request.Rows as strings does not. Labels come from the resolved culture and order by the interval rather than the alphabet. PivotFilter gained an Interval and DistinctValues an optional one, so a filter set from a month header compares month names against months.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/alican645/PivotForge</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/alican645/PivotForge.git</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <Deterministic>true</Deterministic>
    <ContinuousIntegrationBuild Condition="'$(CI)' == 'true'">true</ContinuousIntegrationBuild>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="/" />
    <None Include="../../assets/brand/pivotforge-icon.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="/" />
    <None Include="../../LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="/" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
